{"seq":1,"slug":"the-founder-of-logic","title":"The Founder Of Logic","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/the-founder-of-logic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-syllogism","title":"三段论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/the-founder-of-logic/the-syllogism","wordCount":1988,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-organon","title":"《工具论》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/core-contributions/the-founder-of-logic/the-organon","wordCount":1701,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现亚里士多德作为\"逻辑学之父\"的贡献。他创立了逻辑学这门学科，其核心是\"三段论\"——一种由两个前提推出结论的演绎推理形式；他系统地研究了推理的有效性，揭示了矛盾律等思维的基本规律。这些成果，连同被后世统称为《工具论》的逻辑著作，奠定了西方形式逻辑的基础，在两千多年里一直是逻辑学的标准。\n"}